        <h1 itemprop="headline">Why I use calendar weeks instead of a rolling 7-day average</h1>
        <p itemprop="description">A rolling 7-day average never finishes a week, because it never stays still long enough to have one. This is the essay on why WeekScale is built around the calendar week instead.</p>
